1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,454
Every visa renewal, foreign
residents in Japan copy

2
00:00:03,454 --> 00:00:06,329
their residence card into
a Japanese paper form.

3
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:10,335
Those values are personal data — they
shouldn't have to leave the device.

4
00:00:11,335 --> 00:00:13,927
FormTwin uses Firebase AI Logic and places

5
00:00:13,927 --> 00:00:16,642
each inference by how
sensitive the data is.

6
00:00:16,992 --> 00:00:19,219
Public forms are analysed in the cloud.

7
00:00:19,219 --> 00:00:22,646
Personal data is read only by
the on-device model in Chrome.

8
00:00:31,335 --> 00:00:34,175
On the public side, Gemini
in the cloud proposes

9
00:00:34,175 --> 00:00:36,543
field definitions for the official form.

10
00:00:36,893 --> 00:00:39,524
A person reviews them.
Only the adopted revision

11
00:00:39,524 --> 00:00:42,265
is signed and bundled into
the personal-entry app.

12
00:00:49,935 --> 00:00:55,056
Field explanations use hybrid inference:
cloud first, and when the network is gone,

13
00:00:55,406 --> 00:00:59,541
Firebase AI Logic falls back to the
model on this device automatically.

14
00:01:17,735 --> 00:01:20,145
The personal-entry app is a separate site.

15
00:01:20,145 --> 00:01:23,645
Its security policy blocks network
connections from the page,

16
00:01:23,995 --> 00:01:27,173
and it starts only after checking
the signed form package.

17
00:01:28,835 --> 00:01:30,542
The card is read on this device.

18
00:01:30,892 --> 00:01:32,742
The results are only candidates —

19
00:01:32,742 --> 00:01:36,105
FormTwin asks you to compare
every character with your card.

20
00:01:43,206 --> 00:01:45,325
If a card number does not look right,

21
00:01:45,325 --> 00:01:48,532
FormTwin will not offer it
with one click — you type it.

22
00:01:48,882 --> 00:01:51,255
Only values you checked
are written to the form.

23
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,370
FormTwin fills the official PDF,

24
00:02:08,370 --> 00:02:11,897
with a font that tells the letter
O and the digit zero apart.

25
00:02:12,247 --> 00:02:14,642
You save it, print it and sign it by hand.

26
00:02:21,468 --> 00:02:22,973
Data lives in memory only.

27
00:02:23,323 --> 00:02:27,650
Ending the session, ten minutes of
inactivity, or leaving the page clears it.

28
00:02:37,951 --> 00:02:41,715
We froze our thresholds before testing
and kept the result that missed them.

29
00:02:42,065 --> 00:02:46,646
On-device AI helps; you stay in
control of every value. FormTwin.
